                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game was a gift I received in July 2013 when I barely had a Steam account. We played it once that day and never again for some unknown reason. \r\n\r\n13 years later, after sorting my 2500+ game library by date and origin, this stands as the oldest game I have yet to retire. I picked up a copy for 2 bucks for a friend and more hours than I expected later we cleaned out all of Monaco.\r\n\r\nDeserving every bit of its indie hit status, the game is simple to play but difficult to execute perfectly. Perfect visuals and music to process the information in front of you. Co-op makes it even better - this is a game you play with friends, and it's no slop.",
